<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Advance shareholders support merger.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Advance shareholders support merger.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advance Bank Australia Ltd said on Monday its shareholders had voted to approve a scheme to merge with St George Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>Advance said 89.75 percent out of a total of 77 percent of shareholders that voted on the proposal approved the scheme and 10.25 percent rejected it.  </p>
<p>Advance said last Friday it had been told by the ASC that the regulator would not interfere in Monday's meeting but would appear at a court hearing on January 6 where the scheme of arrangement proposal must also be approved.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
